### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### Login (sets admin_token cookie)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{ADMIN_EMAIL}}",
  "password": "{{ADMIN_PASSWORD}}",
  "remember": true
}

### Admin: list requests (requires cookie or Bearer token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/requests
Cookie: admin_token={{{{adminToken}}}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Payment: create checkout session
POST {{baseUrl}}/create-checkout-session
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "John Doe",
  "phone": "+4912345678",
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "address": "Berlin, DE",
  "operator": "Telekom",
  "connectionType": "DSL",
  "delay": "none",
  "details": "Test SOS via REST Client"
}

### Payment: get checkout session by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/checkout-session/{{checkoutSessionId}}

### Payment: capture payment intent
POST {{baseUrl}}/capture
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "payment_intent_id": "{{payment_intent_id}}",
  "amount_to_capture": 50
}

### Payment: cancel payment intent
POST {{baseUrl}}/cancel
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "payment_intent_id": "{{payment_intent_id}}"
}

### Webhook: Stripe (send raw payload, set signature header)
POST {{baseUrl}}/webhook/stripe
Content-Type: application/json
stripe-signature: {{stripe_signature}}

{
  "type": "payment_intent.succeeded",
  "data": { "object": { "id": "pi_test" } }
}